    "description": "The Utility Billing Estimates API provides access to detailed estimates for utility bills. Users can retrieve estimated billing data based on consumption patterns and usage history, enabling better financial planning and budgeting for both residential and commercial clients. This API is essential for utility service providers, enabling them to forecast revenue and optimize customer communications. Typical consumers include utility companies and their customers who seek insights into projected charges.",
